            "review_title": "Review at The Canvas Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Christy T\n1 contribution\n0\nMs. Barbara, Chef Roberto, and their team provided exceptional service\nJan 2024 • Friends\nWe had to make a reservation for 18 people and we're located outside of Vietnam. Ms. Barbara was very helpful. She and her team provided exceptional service. Chef Roberto was great and the food was very delicious. We had a blast and thank you to all for making our dinner memorable.\nInsider tip:\nChef Roberto and his team provided excellent service. Very accommodating and very courteous.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 22, 2024",
